{"pull": {"id": "number:23075", "number": 23075, "title": "KAFKA-20850: Add system test for suppress() changelog across the HEADERS boundary", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-08-04T13:18:48Z", "closed_at": "2026-08-21T16:54:05Z", "merged_at": "2026-08-21T16:54:04Z", "user": {"login": "aliehsaeedii", "id": 107070585, "node_id": "U_kgDOBmHEeQ", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107070585?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii", "html_url": "https://github.com/aliehsaeedii", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aliehsaeedii/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The smoke-test application already uses\n`suppress(untilWindowCloses(...))` (`SmokeTestClient#183,195`), and\n`streams_application_upgrade_test.py` already drives it across versions\n— but no system test ever set `dsl.store.format`. With the config unset,\nthe headers-aware suppress buffer writes byte-identical V3 records, so\nthe existing matrix passes regardless of KAFKA-20413.\n\nThis adds a HEADERS-configured transition across the 4.3/trunk boundary\nin both directions.\n\nReviewers: Matthias J. Sax <matthias@confluent.io>, Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/